      <SubComponents>
        <Component class="javax.swing.JTextArea" name="txtHelpArea">
          <Properties>
            <Property name="columns" type="int" value="20"/>
            <Property name="rows" type="int" value="5"/>
            <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="Welcome to the Sunrise Dental Clinic System! &#xa;&#xa;1) LOGIN:&#xa;- Enter your authorized staff username and password.&#xa;- Only registered staff can access the main menu.&#xa;&#xa;2) REGISTER NEW APPOINTMENT:&#xa;- Navigate to &quot;Register Appointment&quot;&#xa;- Fill in patient details (Name, Address, 10-digit Contact)&#xa;- Enter Date/Time in 24-hour format (e.g., 2026-09-05 14:00)&#xa;- The system will automatically prevent double-bookings.&#xa;&#xa;3) DISPLAY APPOINTMENT DETAILS:&#xa;- Navigate to &quot;View Appointments&quot;&#xa;- Enter the unique Appointment ID and click Search to view full details&#xa;&#xa;4) CALCULATE AND PRINT BILL:&#xa;- Navigate to &quot;Billing&quot;&#xa;- Enter the Appointment ID and click &quot;Calculate Bill&quot;&#xa;- Click &quot;Print and Save Receipt&quot; to finalize the transaction&#xa;&#xa;5) EXIT SYSTEM&#xa;- Safely close the application using the Exit or Logout&#xa;"/>
          </Properties>
        </Component>
      </SubComponents>
    </Container>
